# Local CLI benchmark assets and generated outputs
cli/tune_bench.md
# The tune bench 2 family: record, procedure, and benchmark sets. Globbed so a
# later file in the family cannot slip into the public repo unlisted.
cli/tune_bench2*
cli/bench/
cli/out/
cli/out2/
server/out/

# Local-only operational files
no-git-sync/
# docs/* rather than docs/: git cannot re-include a path under an excluded
# directory, and docs/assets/ holds the images the READMEs publish.
# Re-include one directory at a time. Never widen this to !docs/*.md: docs/
# used to hold the private operating conventions, and a broad rule would
# publish whatever a later session drops here. Private documents now live in
# no-git-sync/docs/ (moved 2026-07-28).
docs/*
!docs/assets/
!docs/spec/
!docs/history/
!docs/guide/

